      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1447,
      "zh": "E = k Σ qᵢ r̂ / r² ，　φ = Σ qᵢ / r　（k = 1，相对单位）",
      "en": "E = k Σ qᵢ r̂ / r² ,  φ = Σ qᵢ / r  (k = 1, relative units)"
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1448,
      "zh": "双击空白处添加电荷（或选“添加”工具后点按画布），拖动移动，右键或选中后按 Delete 删除（最多 8 个）；试探电荷满足 F = qE，带阻尼与边界反弹。",
      "en": "Double-click empty space to add a charge (or pick the Add tool and click the canvas); drag to move, right-click or press Delete on a selection to remove (max 8); the test charge obeys F = qE, with damping and boundary bounce."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1451,
      "zh": "B = μ₀ I / (2π r)，方向沿圆周切向（右手螺旋定则）　（相对单位 μ₀ = 2π）",
      "en": "B = μ₀ I / (2π r), tangent to the circle (right-hand rule)  (relative units μ₀ = 2π)"
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1452,
      "zh": "用工具在空白处点按添加导线；点按已有导线在 ⊙ 向外（红）与 ⊗ 向里（蓝）间切换；可拖动，右键删除；小磁针沿 B 方向实时偏转。",
      "en": "Use the tool to click empty space to add a wire; click an existing wire to toggle between ⊙ out of the page (red) and ⊗ into the page (blue); drag to move, right-click to delete; compass needles turn live along B."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1455,
      "zh": "磁偶极子（磁极对）近似：B 由 N、S 两极的 1/r² 场叠加，磁感线自 N 极出发回到 S 极",
      "en": "Magnetic dipole (pole pair) approximation: B is the 1/r² fields of the N and S poles superposed; field lines leave the N pole and return to the S pole"
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1456,
      "zh": "拖动磁铁移动；选中后拖动 N 极端的青色圆点旋转（也可用上方按钮）；异极相对时场线跨接，同极相对时场线相斥；铁屑沿 B 方向排列。",
      "en": "Drag a magnet to move it; after selecting, drag the cyan dot at the N-pole end to rotate (or use the buttons above); opposite poles facing bridge the field lines, like poles repel them; iron filings align along B."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1459,
      "zh": "∮ B·dl = μ₀ I_encl ，　B = μ₀ I / (2π r)",
      "en": "∮ B·dl = μ₀ I_encl ,  B = μ₀ I / (2π r)"
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1460,
      "zh": "拖动环路边缘移动整个环路，拖橙色圆点改变尺寸；点按导线切换电流方向，滑块调节 |I|；环路不包围导线时积分应接近 0。",
      "en": "Drag the loop edge to move the whole loop and drag the orange dot to resize; click a wire to flip its current and use the slider for |I|; with no wire enclosed the integral should be near 0."
    },
